  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left center\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>Now, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now plotting the diagram we get,<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c0062bd7-4730-4705-a3bd-6a3140876343.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 156px;\" /><br />Now from above diagram we can say that function is continuous but not differentiable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;due to sharp corner.</p>",
